  "s1": {
   "x": 4060,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 420,
   "fill": "blue",
   "size": "m",
   "text": "How to read these boards\n\nEach board is one block-theme template at 1440px, built from the real design-system CSS. Columns follow the site's navigation, left to right, top to bottom.\n\nBlue chips name the pattern and blocks that build each section: core/* are WordPress core blocks, ot/* are the theme's custom blocks.\n\nThe header and footer boards are the two template parts; every page imports them.\n\nTurn the chips off with the Show blocks tweak on any board."
  },
  "s2": {
   "x": 4560,
   "y": 0,
   "w": 420,
   "fill": "blue",
   "size": "m",
   "text": "Phone boards (390px)\n\nA phone board sits to the right of its desktop template and imports it, so the two never drift apart: edit the 1440px board and the 390px one follows.\n\nBelow 1024px the header swaps its navigation for the overlay menu; below 832px every split stacks to one column; cards go one-up below 576px.\n\nBlock chips are off by default on phone boards; turn them on with the Show blocks tweak."
  },
  "t4": {
   "x": 0,
   "y": 21810,
   "text": "Our team: the team page, the joint page and one profile per agent",
   "kind": "title1",
   "maxW": 10030
  },
  "s3": {
   "x": 10150,
   "y": 22070,
   "w": 420,
   "fill": "blue",
   "size": "m",
   "text": "Agent profiles\n\nOne single-agent.html template serves every agent: Brandon, Kaitlyn and anyone who joins later. Switch the board's Agent tweak between brandon, kaitlyn and template.\n\nBuilt for search and answer engines from the start: ProfilePage + Person JSON-LD linked by @id to the team and REWAP, FAQPage, BreadcrumbList, an answer-first summary, quick facts and a dated update line.\n\nBuilt for conversion: message and call above the fold, a fixed phone action bar, service links and a form attributed to the agent.\n\nUnconfirmed facts stay as [bracketed placeholders]; photos are interim crops of the team portrait."
  }
 },
